# Koschei Web3

Standalone components from Koschei Web3 Hub for Solana event normalization and ARVIS evidence validation.

- [Solana event normalizer](oss/event-normalizer/README.md) for Pump-style and Raydium-style observations
- [ARVIS signed-verdict schema](oss/schemas/signed-verdict.schema.json) and [TypeScript structure checker](oss/verifier/typescript/index.ts)
- [ARVIS dossier integrity checker](oss/verifier/typescript/verify-dossier.mjs) for dossier structure and bundle hashes
- [Koschei Fabric contracts](fabric/contracts) for component manifests and security case envelopes

The verdict structure checker validates signature metadata. Cryptographic signature verification requires a trusted public key and independent verification.

## Quick start

```sh
cd oss/event-normalizer
npm ci
npm run check
npm test
```

